ns la javadoc ou le support de cours)"}]}]},"autoAppliedRules":[]},{"id":"21d9b189-fcca-4420-b327-62c1f0d6f23f","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thought","text":"**Preparing to check repository rules file**"},{"type":"toolCall","toolCallId":"call_I0W9WH0dqxZ4LcEax46Ww0j9","title":"","statusText":"File not found","status":"WARNING","isHidden":false},{"type":"thought","text":"**Noting missing file issue**"},{"type":"text","text":"# Préparation

